    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/aster-real-estate/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Aster Real Estate theme is a modern, professional, and multipurpose solution designed for real estate agencies, property dealers, realtors, brokers, housing consultants, property management companies, rental services, and real estate developers. Ideal for real estate website templates, property listing layouts, agency portals, realtor pages, broker platforms, residential and commercial property showcases, and rental service sites, this theme features a clean, elegant, and fully responsive design that ensures a seamless experience across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. It includes dedicated sections for property listings, featured properties, agent profiles, client testimonials, interactive banners, and strategically placed call-to-action buttons to drive inquiries and leads. Built with secure, optimized, and SEO-friendly code, the theme allows easy customization of colors, fonts, and layouts to reflect your brand identity. Fully compatible with WooCommerce for property sales or bookings and Contact Form 7 for client inquiries, Aster Real Estate provides a high-performing, professional platform to showcase properties, attract potential buyers or tenants, and grow your real estate business online."
    },
